<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>数学 on 刘贵泷的个人网页</title><link>https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/tags/%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6/</link><description>Recent content in 数学 on 刘贵泷的个人网页</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>Guilong Liu</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/tags/%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>LeetCode 9：回文数</title><link>https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/p/leetcode-9%E5%9B%9E%E6%96%87%E6%95%B0/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/p/leetcode-9%E5%9B%9E%E6%96%87%E6%95%B0/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="题目">题目
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>给你一个整数 &lt;code>x&lt;/code>，如果 &lt;code>x&lt;/code> 是一个回文整数，返回 &lt;code>True&lt;/code>，否则返回 &lt;code>False&lt;/code>。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>回文数就是从左往右读和从右往左读完全一样的整数。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>题目链接：&lt;a class="link" href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/palindrome-number/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>LeetCode 9：回文数&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>难度：简单&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>示例：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>121 → 121 → True
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>123 → 321 → False
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>-121 → 121- → False
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="我的思路">我的思路
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>我的原始思路是先把整数转换成字符串，然后比较字符串左右两侧的对称字符：&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>使用 &lt;code>str(x)&lt;/code> 把整数转换成字符串。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>使用 &lt;code>len(s)&lt;/code> 得到字符串长度。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>从字符串左侧开始遍历。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>比较左边第 &lt;code>i&lt;/code> 个字符和右边对应位置的字符。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>只要发现一组字符不同，就立即返回 &lt;code>False&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>如果所有对称位置都相同，就返回 &lt;code>True&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>原代码中的 &lt;code>flag = 0&lt;/code> 没有被使用，可以删除。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>另外，原来的 &lt;code>range(n)&lt;/code> 会把相同位置重复比较。例如：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>字符： 1 2 3 2 1
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>下标： 0 1 2 3 4
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>实际上只需要比较：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>0 ↔ 4
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>1 ↔ 3
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>因此只遍历字符串的一半即可：&lt;code>range(n // 2)&lt;/code>。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="推荐解法比较左右对称字符">推荐解法：比较左右对称字符
&lt;/h2>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">10
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">class&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Solution&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">def&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">isPalindrome&lt;/span>(self, x: int) &lt;span style="color:#f92672">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span> bool:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> s &lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span> str(x)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> n &lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span> len(s)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">for&lt;/span> i &lt;span style="color:#f92672">in&lt;/span> range(n &lt;span style="color:#f92672">//&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">2&lt;/span>):
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">if&lt;/span> s[i] &lt;span style="color:#f92672">!=&lt;/span> s[n &lt;span style="color:#f92672">-&lt;/span> i &lt;span style="color:#f92672">-&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">1&lt;/span>]:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">return&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">False&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">return&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">True&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>长度为 &lt;code>n&lt;/code> 的字符串最后一个下标是 &lt;code>n - 1&lt;/code>，所以位置 &lt;code>i&lt;/code> 在右侧的对称位置就是：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>n - i - 1
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>例如 &lt;code>n = 5&lt;/code> 时：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>i = 0 → 5 - 0 - 1 = 4
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>i = 1 → 5 - 1 - 1 = 3
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;code>return False&lt;/code> 可以放在循环内部，因为发现一组字符不相同后，就已经可以确定它不是回文数。&lt;code>return True&lt;/code> 必须放在循环结束之后，表示所有对称位置都检查通过。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="python-简洁写法">Python 简洁写法
&lt;/h2>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">class&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Solution&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">def&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">isPalindrome&lt;/span>(self, x: int) &lt;span style="color:#f92672">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span> bool:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> s &lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span> str(x)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">return&lt;/span> s &lt;span style="color:#f92672">==&lt;/span> s[::&lt;span style="color:#f92672">-&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">1&lt;/span>]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;code>s[::-1]&lt;/code> 表示把字符串反转：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>s &lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;123&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>s[::&lt;span style="color:#f92672">-&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">1&lt;/span>] &lt;span style="color:#75715e"># &amp;#34;321&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这种写法很简洁，但练习阶段更建议先掌握左右比较的过程，理解回文问题的核心逻辑。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="不使用字符串的数学解法">不使用字符串的数学解法
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>也可以通过取出每一位数字的方式反转整数：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">14
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">class&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">Solution&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">def&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">isPalindrome&lt;/span>(self, x: int) &lt;span style="color:#f92672">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span> bool:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">if&lt;/span> x &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;lt;&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">0&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">return&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">False&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> original &lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span> x
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> reversed_num &lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">while&lt;/span> x &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">0&lt;/span>:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> digit &lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span> x &lt;span style="color:#f92672">%&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> reversed_num &lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span> reversed_num &lt;span style="color:#f92672">*&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">+&lt;/span> digit
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> x &lt;span style="color:#f92672">//=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">return&lt;/span> original &lt;span style="color:#f92672">==&lt;/span> reversed_num
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这里有两个重要操作：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>x &lt;span style="color:#f92672">%&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#75715e"># 取得最后一位，例如 123 % 10 == 3&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>x &lt;span style="color:#f92672">//&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#75715e"># 去掉最后一位，例如 123 // 10 == 12&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>以 &lt;code>123&lt;/code> 为例：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>x = 123，取出 3，reversed_num = 3，x = 12
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>x = 12，取出 2，reversed_num = 32，x = 1
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>x = 1，取出 1，reversed_num = 321，x = 0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>最后比较原数字和反转后的数字是否相同。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="复杂度">复杂度
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>假设整数有 &lt;code>n&lt;/code> 位：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>字符串比较的时间复杂度：&lt;code>O(n)&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>字符串方法的额外空间复杂度：&lt;code>O(n)&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>数学方法的额外空间复杂度：&lt;code>O(1)&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>时间复杂度表示程序需要进行多少计算，空间复杂度表示运行时额外需要多少存储空间。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="关键知识点">关键知识点
&lt;/h2>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>&lt;code>str(x)&lt;/code> 可以把整数转换成字符串。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>len(s)&lt;/code> 可以获得字符串长度。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Python 的下标从 &lt;code>0&lt;/code> 开始。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>长度为 &lt;code>n&lt;/code> 的字符串最后一个位置是 &lt;code>n - 1&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>位置 &lt;code>i&lt;/code> 的左右对称位置是 &lt;code>n - i - 1&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>回文问题可以从左右两端同时比较。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>发现不相等时可以立即返回 &lt;code>False&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>x % 10&lt;/code> 可以取得正整数的最后一位。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>x // 10&lt;/code> 可以去掉正整数的最后一位。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;h2 id="复盘">复盘
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>这道题的核心不是背下完整代码，而是理解左右对称关系：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>左端 → → → 中间 ← ← ← 右端
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>以后看到“正着读和反着读一样”“左右是否对称”“从两端进行比较”等描述时，可以想到双指针（Two Pointers）这一类思路。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>本题最推荐掌握的版本是：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 2
